@startuml Security_Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white

package "IAM Security Model" {
    component Principle as "Principle of Least Privilege\nGrant Methods Only\nNo Wildcard Policies*"
    
    component Lambda_Roles as "Lambda Execution Roles\nFunction-Specific Permissions\nResource-Scoped Access"
    
    component API_Auth as "API Gateway Authorization\nCognito JWT Validation\nUser Context Injection"
    
    component S3_Security as "S3 Security\nPublic Read for Photos\nPresigned URLs for Upload\nCORS Configuration"
    
    component DDB_Security as "DynamoDB Security\nItem-Level Access Control\nUser-Scoped Queries\nGSI Permissions"
}

Principle --> Lambda_Roles
Principle --> API_Auth
Principle --> S3_Security
Principle --> DDB_Security

note bottom : *Exception: Nova Lite requires\nwildcard due to cross-region\ninference profile routing

@enduml
